cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  elevation-map-completion: robot-centric elevation map completion with
  sensor-geometry-aware augmentation and uncertainty estimation
message: >-
  If you use this software or the released model weights, please cite the
  accompanying paper (preferred-citation) and the TartanGround dataset it is
  built on (references).
